f":"#p-11210-h-1","text":"#p-11210-h-1","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-11210-1","text":"[1]","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-11210-2","text":"[2]","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-11210-3","text":"[3]","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-11210-4","text":"[4]","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-11210-5","text":"[5]","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-11210-6","text":"[6]","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-11210-7","text":"[7]","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-11210-8","text":"[8]","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-11210-9","text":"[9]","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-11210-10","text":"[10]","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-11210-11","text":"[11]","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-1","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-2","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-3","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-4","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-5","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-6","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-7","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-8","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-9","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-10","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-11","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":3},{"href":"#p-11211-h-1","text":"#p-11211-h-1","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-11211-1","text":"[1]","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-11211-2","text":"[2]","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-11211-3","text":"[3]","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-11211-4","text":"[4]","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11211-1","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11211-2","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11211-3","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":4},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11211-4","text":"↩︎","kind":"link","postNumber":4}],"resourceCounts":{},"annotations":[{"title":"教材圖頁","body":"已對應教材圖片 p9 起，可在圖頁欄對照原書版面、頁碼和課文位置。"},{"title":"延伸資源","body":"本課從論壇回覆抽取 68 條連結/附件，按所在樓層保留，便於追溯。"},{"title":"學習路線","body":"先讀主樓，旁看教材圖頁，再用回覆資源補證據；最後把自己的問題丟給 AI 或討論區。"}],"learningTasks":[{"id":"restate","title":"三分鐘復述","prompt":"不看原文，用三分鐘說清《古诗词诵读 155》的核心問題、人物/論點與一句最關鍵的證據。"},{"id":"evidence","title":"證據標註","prompt":"從主樓或教材圖頁中選兩處原文，分別標出：字面意思、語氣/修辭、可被考查的點。"},{"id":"transfer","title":"遷移追問","prompt":"結合回覆中的一條學習資源，設計一道可討論的問題，要求回答者必須回到文本取證。"}],"posts":[{"id":11208,"post_number":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-22T14:36:38Z","updated_at":"2024-08-22T14:36:38Z","like_count":0,"cooked":"<h2><a name=\"p-11208-h-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-11208-h-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>登岳阳楼</h2>\n<p><strong>杜 甫</strong></p>\n<p>昔闻洞庭水，今上岳阳楼。<br>\n吴楚东南坼<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11208-1\" id=\"footnote-ref-11208-1\">[1]</a></sup>，乾坤<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11208-2\" id=\"footnote-ref-11208-2\">[2]</a></sup>日夜浮。<br>\n亲朋无一字，老病有孤舟。<br>\n戎马关山北<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11208-3\" id=\"footnote-ref-11208-3\">[3]</a></sup>，凭轩<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11208-4\" id=\"footnote-ref-11208-4\">[4]</a></sup>涕泗<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11208-5\" id=\"footnote-ref-11208-5\">[5]</a></sup>流。</p>\n<p>这首诗开篇虽只是平平的交代，却蕴含着强烈的今昔对比之感。接下来描绘洞庭湖分断吴楚、吐纳日月，写出它极其恢宏的气象。后四句转写孤舟老病之身世，看似悲戚，可对国家安危、时局动荡的忧思尽在其中，由此可见作者心胸之博大。诵读这首诗，要留意诗人困顿的处境，感受他痛切的心情，更要理解他心系天下的胸怀。可以拓展阅读《客至》等杜甫其他作品，进一步了解杜甫诗歌多样化的艺术风格。</p>\n<hr>\n<hr class=\"footnotes-sep\">\n\n<ol class=\"footnotes-list\">\n<li id=\"footnote-11208-1\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 坼（chè）：分裂。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11208-1\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11208-2\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 乾坤：指日月。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11208-2\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11208-3\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 戎马关山北：指战事起于北部边境地区。当时吐蕃正侵扰陇右、关中一带。戎马，战马，代指战争。关山，在今宁夏南部。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11208-3\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11208-4\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 凭轩：倚窗。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11208-4\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11208-5\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 涕泗（sì）：眼泪鼻涕。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11208-5\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>","plain_text":"登岳阳楼 杜 甫 昔闻洞庭水，今上岳阳楼。 吴楚东南坼[1]，乾坤[2]日夜浮。 亲朋无一字，老病有孤舟。 戎马关山北[3]，凭轩[4]涕泗[5]流。 这首诗开篇虽只是平平的交代，却蕴含着强烈的今昔对比之感。接下来描绘洞庭湖分断吴楚、吐纳日月，写出它极其恢宏的气象。后四句转写孤舟老病之身世，看似悲戚，可对国家安危、时局动荡的忧思尽在其中，由此可见作者心胸之博大。诵读这首诗，要留意诗人困顿的处境，感受他痛切的心情，更要理解他心系天下的胸怀。可以拓展阅读《客至》等杜甫其他作品，进一步了解杜甫诗歌多样化的艺术风格。 [color=red] 坼（chè）：分裂。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 乾坤：指日月。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 戎马关山北：指战事起于北部边境地区。当时吐蕃正侵扰陇右、关中一带。戎马，战马，代指战争。关山，在今宁夏南部。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 凭轩：倚窗。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 涕泗（sì）：眼泪鼻涕。[/color] ↩︎","images":[],"links":[{"href":"#p-11208-h-1","text":"#p-11208-h-1","title":"","classes":"anchor","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11208-1","text":"[1]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11208-2","text":"[2]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11208-3","text":"[3]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11208-4","text":"[4]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11208-5","text":"[5]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11208-1","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11208-2","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11208-3","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11208-4","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11208-5","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false}],"attachments":[]},{"id":11209,"post_number":2,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-22T14:37:42Z","updated_at":"2024-08-22T14:37:42Z","like_count":0,"cooked":"<blockquote>\n<p><em>选自《临川先生文集》卷三十七（《王安石全集》第5 册，复旦大学出版社2016 年版）。桂枝香，词牌名。</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><a name=\"p-11209-h-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-11209-h-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>桂枝香·金陵怀古</h2>\n<p><strong>王安石</strong></p>\n<p>登临送目<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11209-1\" id=\"footnote-ref-11209-1\">[1]</a></sup>，正故国<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11209-2\" id=\"footnote-ref-11209-2\">[2]</a></sup>晚秋，天气初肃<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11209-3\" id=\"footnote-ref-11209-3\">[3]</a></sup>。<br>\n千里澄江似练，翠峰如簇<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11209-4\" id=\"footnote-ref-11209-4\">[4]</a></sup>。<br>\n归帆去棹残阳里，背西风，酒旗斜矗。<br>\n彩舟云淡，星河<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11209-5\" id=\"footnote-ref-11209-5\">[5]</a></sup>鹭起，画图难足<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11209-6\" id=\"footnote-ref-11209-6\">[6]</a></sup>。</p>\n<p>念往昔，繁华竞逐<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11209-7\" id=\"footnote-ref-11209-7\">[7]</a></sup>，叹门外楼头<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11209-8\" id=\"footnote-ref-11209-8\">[8]</a></sup>，悲恨相续<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11209-9\" id=\"footnote-ref-11209-9\">[9]</a></sup>。<br>\n千古凭高<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11209-10\" id=\"footnote-ref-11209-10\">[10]</a></sup>对此，谩嗟荣辱<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11209-11\" id=\"footnote-ref-11209-11\">[11]</a></sup>。<br>\n六朝旧事随流水，但寒烟衰草凝绿。<br>\n至今商女，时时犹唱，后庭遗曲<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11209-12\" id=\"footnote-ref-11209-12\">[12]</a></sup>。</p>\n<p>这首词是王安石在金陵写的登高怀古之作。上片先点明登临时节，随后写眼前景色。澄江似练，夕阳翠峰，酒旗招展，白鹭翔舞，确是一幅优美的图画。下片感叹六朝竞逐奢靡繁华而相继灭亡，只剩下寒烟衰草；继而陈说空叹兴亡荣辱其实没有意义，奋起变革，有所作为，才可以避免重蹈覆辙。张炎在《词源·意趣》中说这首词“清空中有意趣”。反复诵读，说说这种“意趣”是什么。</p>\n<hr>\n<hr class=\"footnotes-sep\">\n\n<ol class=\"footnotes-list\">\n<li id=\"footnote-11209-1\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 登临送目，登山临水，放眼远眺。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11209-1\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11209-2\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 故国，故都，这里指金陵。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11209-2\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11209-3\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 肃，肃爽，天高气爽。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11209-3\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11209-4\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 翠峰如簇，聚集在一起的山峰。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11209-4\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11209-5\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 星河，天河，这里指长江。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11209-5\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11209-6\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 画图难足，图画难以完备地展现。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11209-6\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11209-7\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 繁华竞逐，争相追逐奢侈豪华生活。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11209-7\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11209-8\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 门外楼头，语出唐杜牧《台城曲》：“门外韩擒虎，楼头张丽华。”[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11209-8\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11209-9\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 悲恨相续，指各个王朝接连覆亡。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11209-9\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11209-10\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 凭高，登临高处。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11209-10\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11209-11\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 谩嗟荣辱，枉自感叹兴亡的荣耀和耻辱。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11209-11\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11209-12\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 至今商女，时时犹唱，后庭遗曲，语出唐杜牧《泊秦淮》：“商女不知亡国恨，隔江犹唱后庭花。”[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11209-12\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>","plain_text":"选自《临川先生文集》卷三十七（《王安石全集》第5 册，复旦大学出版社2016 年版）。桂枝香，词牌名。 桂枝香·金陵怀古 王安石 登临送目[1]，正故国[2]晚秋，天气初肃[3]。 千里澄江似练，翠峰如簇[4]。 归帆去棹残阳里，背西风，酒旗斜矗。 彩舟云淡，星河[5]鹭起，画图难足[6]。 念往昔，繁华竞逐[7]，叹门外楼头[8]，悲恨相续[9]。 千古凭高[10]对此，谩嗟荣辱[11]。 六朝旧事随流水，但寒烟衰草凝绿。 至今商女，时时犹唱，后庭遗曲[12]。 这首词是王安石在金陵写的登高怀古之作。上片先点明登临时节，随后写眼前景色。澄江似练，夕阳翠峰，酒旗招展，白鹭翔舞，确是一幅优美的图画。下片感叹六朝竞逐奢靡繁华而相继灭亡，只剩下寒烟衰草；继而陈说空叹兴亡荣辱其实没有意义，奋起变革，有所作为，才可以避免重蹈覆辙。张炎在《词源·意趣》中说这首词“清空中有意趣”。反复诵读，说说这种“意趣”是什么。 [color=red] 登临送目，登山临水，放眼远眺。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 故国，故都，这里指金陵。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 肃，肃爽，天高气爽。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 翠峰如簇，聚集在一起的山峰。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 星河，天河，这里指长江。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 画图难足，图画难以完备地展现。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 繁华竞逐，争相追逐奢侈豪华生活。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 门外楼头，语出唐杜牧《台城曲》：“门外韩擒虎，楼头张丽华。”[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 悲恨相续，指各个王朝接连覆亡。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 凭高，登临高处。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 谩嗟荣辱，枉自感叹兴亡的荣耀和耻辱。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 至今商女，时时犹唱，后庭遗曲，语出唐杜牧《泊秦淮》：“商女不知亡国恨，隔江犹唱后庭花。”[/color] ↩︎","images":[],"links":[{"href":"#p-11209-h-1","text":"#p-11209-h-1","title":"","classes":"anchor","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11209-1","text":"[1]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11209-2","text":"[2]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11209-3","text":"[3]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11209-4","text":"[4]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11209-5","text":"[5]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11209-6","text":"[6]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11209-7","text":"[7]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11209-8","text":"[8]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11209-9","text":"[9]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11209-10","text":"[10]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11209-11","text":"[11]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11209-12","text":"[12]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-1","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-2","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-3","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-4","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-5","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-6","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-7","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-8","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-9","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-10","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-11","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-12","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false}],"attachments":[]},{"id":11210,"post_number":3,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-22T14:44:38Z","updated_at":"2024-08-22T14:44:38Z","like_count":0,"cooked":"<blockquote>\n<p>*选自《张孝祥词校笺》卷一（中华书局2010 年版）。<em>张孝祥（1132—1170），字安国，号于湖居士，乌江（今安徽和县东北）人，南宋词人。宋孝宗乾道二年（1166），张孝祥因人进谗言而被罢官，由桂林北归，途经洞庭湖时作此词。</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><a name=\"p-11210-h-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-11210-h-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>念奴娇·过洞庭</h2>\n<p><strong>张孝祥</strong></p>\n<p>洞庭青草<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11210-1\" id=\"footnote-ref-11210-1\">[1]</a></sup>，近中秋，更无一点风色<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11210-2\" id=\"footnote-ref-11210-2\">[2]</a></sup>。<br>\n玉鉴琼田<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11210-3\" id=\"footnote-ref-11210-3\">[3]</a></sup>三万顷，着我扁舟一叶。<br>\n素月分辉，明河共影，表里俱澄澈<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11210-4\" id=\"footnote-ref-11210-4\">[4]</a></sup>。<br>\n悠然心会<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11210-5\" id=\"footnote-ref-11210-5\">[5]</a></sup>，妙处难与君说。</p>\n<p>应念岭海经年，孤光自照，肝肺皆冰雪<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11210-6\" id=\"footnote-ref-11210-6\">[6]</a></sup>。<br>\n短发萧骚<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11210-7\" id=\"footnote-ref-11210-7\">[7]</a></sup>襟袖冷，稳泛沧浪空阔。<br>\n尽挹<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11210-8\" id=\"footnote-ref-11210-8\">[8]</a></sup>西江<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11210-9\" id=\"footnote-ref-11210-9\">[9]</a></sup>，细斟北斗<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11210-10\" id=\"footnote-ref-11210-10\">[10]</a></sup>，万象为宾客。<br>\n扣舷独啸，不知今夕何夕<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11210-11\" id=\"footnote-ref-11210-11\">[11]</a></sup>！</p>\n<p>词人罢官北归，时近中秋，途经洞庭，写了这首词来描摹洞庭月色，并抒发自己的怀抱。万顷湖面上，作者荡一叶扁舟，扣舷独啸，看起来极为渺小。但是，他“肝肺皆冰雪”的胸怀，与洞庭月下“表里俱澄澈”的气象交融；他包罗天地万象的想象，与浩渺无限的自然融合，超越了世俗的宠辱得失。诵读这首词，想象其中恢宏的意境，体会词人高洁的人格。</p>\n<hr>\n<hr class=\"footnotes-sep\">\n\n<ol class=\"footnotes-list\">\n<li id=\"footnote-11210-1\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 青草，即青草湖，在今湖南岳阳西南，属南洞庭湖。南朝宋盛弘之《荆州记》载：“巴陵南有青草湖，周回数百里，日月出没其中。”[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11210-1\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11210-2\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 风色，风。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11210-2\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11210-3\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 玉鉴琼田，形容月光下洞庭湖皎洁的水面。鉴，镜子。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11210-3\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11210-4\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 素月分辉，明河共影，表里俱澄澈，意思是明月光辉四射，银河与明月一同映入湖水之中，上上下下全都清亮明洁。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11210-4\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11210-5\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 悠然心会，指内心优游自在，与眼前景物相合。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11210-5\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11210-6\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 应念岭海经年，孤光自照，肝肺皆冰雪，意思是应思量在岭外一年左右的官场生活中，月光本就在照耀陪伴，自己的心胸全部像冰雪一样明洁。岭海，五岭至南海之间的地域，指今两广一带。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11210-6\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11210-7\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 萧骚，稀疏。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11210-7\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11210-8\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 挹（yì），舀（水）。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11210-8\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11210-9\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 西江，长江。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11210-9\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11210-10\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 细斟北斗，意思是用天上的北斗舀取长江水细细品酌。北斗，北斗七星，排列成斗勺形，比喻酒器。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11210-10\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11210-11\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 不知今夕何夕，这里是极度赞叹此夜之美好。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11210-11\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>","plain_text":"*选自《张孝祥词校笺》卷一（中华书局2010 年版）。张孝祥（1132—1170），字安国，号于湖居士，乌江（今安徽和县东北）人，南宋词人。宋孝宗乾道二年（1166），张孝祥因人进谗言而被罢官，由桂林北归，途经洞庭湖时作此词。 念奴娇·过洞庭 张孝祥 洞庭青草[1]，近中秋，更无一点风色[2]。 玉鉴琼田[3]三万顷，着我扁舟一叶。 素月分辉，明河共影，表里俱澄澈[4]。 悠然心会[5]，妙处难与君说。 应念岭海经年，孤光自照，肝肺皆冰雪[6]。 短发萧骚[7]襟袖冷，稳泛沧浪空阔。 尽挹[8]西江[9]，细斟北斗[10]，万象为宾客。 扣舷独啸，不知今夕何夕[11]！ 词人罢官北归，时近中秋，途经洞庭，写了这首词来描摹洞庭月色，并抒发自己的怀抱。万顷湖面上，作者荡一叶扁舟，扣舷独啸，看起来极为渺小。但是，他“肝肺皆冰雪”的胸怀，与洞庭月下“表里俱澄澈”的气象交融；他包罗天地万象的想象，与浩渺无限的自然融合，超越了世俗的宠辱得失。诵读这首词，想象其中恢宏的意境，体会词人高洁的人格。 [color=red] 青草，即青草湖，在今湖南岳阳西南，属南洞庭湖。南朝宋盛弘之《荆州记》载：“巴陵南有青草湖，周回数百里，日月出没其中。”[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 风色，风。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 玉鉴琼田，形容月光下洞庭湖皎洁的水面。鉴，镜子。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 素月分辉，明河共影，表里俱澄澈，意思是明月光辉四射，银河与明月一同映入湖水之中，上上下下全都清亮明洁。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 悠然心会，指内心优游自在，与眼前景物相合。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 应念岭海经年，孤光自照，肝肺皆冰雪，意思是应思量在岭外一年左右的官场生活中，月光本就在照耀陪伴，自己的心胸全部像冰雪一样明洁。岭海，五岭至南海之间的地域，指今两广一带。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 萧骚，稀疏。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 挹（yì），舀（水）。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 西江，长江。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 细斟北斗，意思是用天上的北斗舀取长江水细细品酌。北斗，北斗七星，排列成斗勺形，比喻酒器。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 不知今夕何夕，这里是极度赞叹此夜之美好。[/color] ↩︎","images":[],"links":[{"href":"#p-11210-h-1","text":"#p-11210-h-1","title":"","classes":"anchor","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11210-1","text":"[1]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11210-2","text":"[2]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11210-3","text":"[3]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11210-4","text":"[4]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11210-5","text":"[5]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11210-6","text":"[6]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11210-7","text":"[7]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11210-8","text":"[8]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11210-9","text":"[9]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11210-10","text":"[10]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11210-11","text":"[11]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-1","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-2","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-3","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-4","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-5","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-6","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-7","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-8","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-9","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-10","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-11","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false}],"attachments":[]},{"id":11211,"post_number":4,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-22T14:46:04Z","updated_at":"2024-08-22T14:46:04Z","like_count":0,"cooked":"<blockquote>\n<p><em>选自《牡丹亭》（《汤显祖戏曲集》，上海古籍出版社 1978 年版）。题目是编者加的。汤显祖（1550—1616），字义仍，号若士，临川（今江西抚州）人，明代戏曲作家。代表作有传奇《紫钗记》《牡丹亭》《南柯记》《邯郸记》，合称“玉茗堂（汤显祖居所名）四梦”或“临川四梦”。《牡丹亭》全剧共五十五出，描写了南安太守杜宝的女儿杜丽娘与书生柳梦梅的爱情故事。这段曲词出自第十出《惊梦》。</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><a name=\"p-11211-h-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-11211-h-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>游 园</h2>\n<p><strong>汤显祖</strong></p>\n<p>【皂罗袍】原来姹紫嫣红开遍，似这般都付与断井颓垣。<br>\n良辰美景奈何天<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11211-1\" id=\"footnote-ref-11211-1\">[1]</a></sup>，赏心乐事谁家<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11211-2\" id=\"footnote-ref-11211-2\">[2]</a></sup>院！<br>\n朝飞暮卷<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11211-3\" id=\"footnote-ref-11211-3\">[3]</a></sup>，云霞翠轩；雨丝风片，烟波画船——锦屏人忒看的这韶光贱<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#footnote-11211-4\" id=\"footnote-ref-11211-4\">[4]</a></sup>！</p>\n<p>杜丽娘出生于官宦家庭，从小受封建家长的管束和封建礼教的压抑。她受到《诗经·关雎》的触动，青春意识开始觉醒。于是违背父母、塾师训诫，走出深闺，偷偷前往后花园游赏。盛开的百花，绚烂的色彩，开启了她的心扉。这段曲词细腻生动地描摹了一个少女青春萌动时的微妙心理，情真意切。诵读时注意把握主人公的情绪流转，体会作者融情于景的写法。</p>\n<hr>\n<hr class=\"footnotes-sep\">\n\n<ol class=\"footnotes-list\">\n<li id=\"footnote-11211-1\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 奈何天，令人无可奈何的时光。多表示百无聊赖的思绪。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11211-1\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11211-2\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 谁家，哪一家。一说作“什么”解。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11211-2\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11211-3\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 朝飞暮卷，语出唐王勃《滕王阁》：“画栋朝飞南浦云，珠帘暮卷西山雨。”[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11211-3\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"footnote-11211-4\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>[color=red] 锦屏人忒看的这韶光贱，意思是，我这深闺女子太辜负这美好春光。锦屏人，深闺中人。忒，过于。看的……贱，把……看轻。韶光，美好的时光，多指春光。[/color] <a href=\"#footnote-ref-11211-4\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>","plain_text":"选自《牡丹亭》（《汤显祖戏曲集》，上海古籍出版社 1978 年版）。题目是编者加的。汤显祖（1550—1616），字义仍，号若士，临川（今江西抚州）人，明代戏曲作家。代表作有传奇《紫钗记》《牡丹亭》《南柯记》《邯郸记》，合称“玉茗堂（汤显祖居所名）四梦”或“临川四梦”。《牡丹亭》全剧共五十五出，描写了南安太守杜宝的女儿杜丽娘与书生柳梦梅的爱情故事。这段曲词出自第十出《惊梦》。 游 园 汤显祖 【皂罗袍】原来姹紫嫣红开遍，似这般都付与断井颓垣。 良辰美景奈何天[1]，赏心乐事谁家[2]院！ 朝飞暮卷[3]，云霞翠轩；雨丝风片，烟波画船——锦屏人忒看的这韶光贱[4]！ 杜丽娘出生于官宦家庭，从小受封建家长的管束和封建礼教的压抑。她受到《诗经·关雎》的触动，青春意识开始觉醒。于是违背父母、塾师训诫，走出深闺，偷偷前往后花园游赏。盛开的百花，绚烂的色彩，开启了她的心扉。这段曲词细腻生动地描摹了一个少女青春萌动时的微妙心理，情真意切。诵读时注意把握主人公的情绪流转，体会作者融情于景的写法。 [color=red] 奈何天，令人无可奈何的时光。多表示百无聊赖的思绪。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 谁家，哪一家。一说作“什么”解。[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 朝飞暮卷，语出唐王勃《滕王阁》：“画栋朝飞南浦云，珠帘暮卷西山雨。”[/color] ↩︎ [color=red] 锦屏人忒看的这韶光贱，意思是，我这深闺女子太辜负这美好春光。锦屏人，深闺中人。忒，过于。看的……贱，把……看轻。韶光，美好的时光，多指春光。[/color] ↩︎","images":[],"links":[{"href":"#p-11211-h-1","text":"#p-11211-h-1","title":"","classes":"anchor","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11211-1","text":"[1]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11211-2","text":"[2]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11211-3","text":"[3]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-11211-4","text":"[4]","title":"","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11211-1","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11211-2","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11211-3","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false},{"href":"#footnote-ref-11211-4","text":"↩︎","title":"","classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false}],"attachments":[]}]}